{"parse": {"title": "AFF-02", "pageid": 123500, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AFF-01\" title=\"AFF-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AFF-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/AFF-03\" title=\"AFF-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AFF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.8F.8B.E5.A5.BD.E8.AF.81.E4.BA.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"友好证人\">友好证人</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 友好证人</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Innocent Bystanders</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>混<span class=\"color-value\"></span>乱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>撇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>清<span class=\"color-value\"></span>关<span class=\"color-value\"></span>系<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>适<span class=\"color-value\"></span>得<span class=\"color-value\"></span>其<span class=\"color-value\"></span>反<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3210102</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_19\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>各位女士各位先生，请大家跟着那位警员到外面登记信息，不要停留在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>占卜沙龙的众人像围栏中的绵羊一样陆续走出，议论声却仍不绝于耳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">参会者Ⅰ：</div><div>真是太可怕了，她临死前的样子……我今晚一定会做噩梦……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">参会者Ⅱ：</div><div>我早和你说不该来！什么占卜……做这种事是会招来厄运的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">参会者Ⅲ：</div><div>会不会是突发的疾病？比如癔症……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">参会者Ⅰ：</div><div>噢，我知道那个，法比奥和弗朗格前几天还提到过！他们的邻居自称自己是黎塞留的轻骑兵，骑着扫帚从窗户跳了出去，现在还在医院里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">参会者Ⅱ：</div><div>或者——你们忘了她说过的话？也许这些真的都是因为……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">参会者Ⅰ：</div><div>——“热沃当的野兽”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>恐惧和一丝隐秘的兴奋爬上每位来客的脸，那个百年前的传说再一次投下骇人的阴影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>女士们，先生们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>巴黎警方一定会优先侦办此案，请各位不要传播流言，不要散播恐慌！我们会保护市民的安全！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们停止了谈论，但从他们的表情来看，恐怕不能指望这番话起到多大的作用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>填满房间的众人散去，只留下了几位关键的“证人”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>这事可不要算在我头上，我根本没有碰到过她！<br />费利西安，你要为我作证……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>费利西安？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉回过头，发现自己的雇主正专注地绕着地上的尸体漫步，眼中闪动着兴味盎然的光彩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640915.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-640915.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640915.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640915.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-640915.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640915.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-640915.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640915.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>没想到还有这样精彩的余兴节目……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>嘿，别离得太近！你这样搞不好会破坏现场的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不免再次为雇主的随心所欲头疼，所幸一旁的警员并没有关注到这边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>唉，又来了，“热沃当的野兽”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>……又？为什么这么说，本杰明警官？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉疑惑地看向熟识的警员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>一个不知道从哪儿出现的流言，根本是无中生有，却传遍了全巴黎！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>总有人报警说碰到了什么“热沃当的野兽”，我们过去一看，连一颗面包渣都没有！不知道他们的脑子出了什么问题！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>街上乱了起来，不少混球也开始不安分，上次喊你帮忙鉴定证物的那个案子也是这样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他捂着额角叹出一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>本来最近就忙！将近半个城的工人都在搞罢工，在工厂里大办舞会……警察的工作已经够多了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>有时候我真羡慕你，阿黛拉。每天开开出租车，陪外地人四处转转就行了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>哈哈……还行吧，大家都有自己的烦恼嘛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉向费利西安的方向瞥了一眼——她似乎已经对那具死尸失去了兴趣，正若有所思地盯着角落的一张空椅子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>哈，就知道你会这么说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警员摸出了本子与笔。待他再抬起头时，脸上那份面对熟人时的亲昵态度已经收起了大半。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>好了，那我们开始吧。有几个问题需要你配合回答一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>虽然咱们也是老朋友了，但公事公办，毕竟你是当时离她最近的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>当然，我明白，警官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>证物已经被尽数撤走，法医正在查看地上的遗体，占卜师的死状狰狞可怖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-641010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-641010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-641010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>口唇发绀，瞳孔放大，手指紧缩，脊柱强直……虽然只是初步鉴定，但这一切都符合惊吓过度致死的表现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-313520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-313520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-313520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>惊吓过度致死？这……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"641010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-641010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-641010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"641010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-641010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-641010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-641010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-641010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>现场当时有没有发生什么特殊的事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>她正在为我占卜。从中途起她的举动就很奇怪，突然死死盯住我，说了一长串听不明白的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>丢下那堆“预言”之后，她提到了“野兽”，接着就倒在地上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>照这么说，她通过占卜，从你身上看到了“热沃当的野兽”，然后……就吓死了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我知道你不信，但看起来确实是这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>二人面面相觑了片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警员拿笔的手迟迟未动——显然他也在评估这番疯话的实际价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后，他合上了本子，露出了相当无奈的表情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>好了，感谢你，阿黛拉。看来我们得考虑把它和城中沸沸扬扬的传言合并调查了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>说到底，“热沃当的野兽”已经是一百多年前的传说了，怎么会现在又莫名其妙地流行起来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>我看这里面有不少问题。现在不止巴黎，全法国都让这些事弄得无法安宁，而混乱总是和谣言相伴而生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>是，很多人都想借着这个传说做点什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>比如这位留下“预言”的占卜师，不知道从哪儿听说了我家的事，趁机拿毫不相干的东西糊弄我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>那个说你们一家人都会为了寻宝而遭遇不测的诅咒？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>只要肯稍微花点工夫打听塔沃尼尔家，这的确也不是什么秘密。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>没错，我不打算太相信她的话。说到底，“诅咒”的说法无非是来自我那几个最为人所知的祖辈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>比如我那位曾曾曾曾曾曾祖父，从印度带回了著名的“法兰西之蓝”，结果不久就死于非命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>又比如我那个曾祖父，为了寻找大革命期间流失到国外的珍宝，因为一场风暴死在了海上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>说是真有某种神秘的力量也好，说是巧合也成。没必要放在心上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>也对……我记得你说过，你父母也是宝石猎人。那他们还好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>还在国外满世界跑呢，我们三个很久没见面了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>不过偶尔会有些信寄回家里，看样子他们应该过得不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警员如释重负地呼出一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>那就好！寻找宝石，周游世界……听着真是不错！肯定比像我这样整天窝在同一个地方，几十年如一日地过日子要有意思多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>你呢？你打算什么时候追随父母的脚步，也做个宝石猎人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>他们是他们，我对那些闪闪发光的东西可没那么大兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我只想过普普通通的日子，赚的钱够花就行，重要的是要舒服、自在。<br />最好工作不要太忙，每天能睡到自然醒，也不需要费太多脑筋……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>当时我和朋友随便在招聘册上翻了一页，第一个出现的词就是“出租车司机”。不得不说，它挺合我心意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>哈哈！的确是你的风格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警员点了点头，将拿在手里的笔记本收回口袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>行了，情况我都大致明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>不用太担心，你没有动机，也没有手段……目前这事看起来和你没什么关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>如果之后还需要你进一步配合调查，我们会联系你。<br />还有什么要补充的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>多谢，本杰明警官。我没有什么要补充的了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>不对！等一下……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_55.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_55\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_55\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Cg-3_2_at_55.png/600px-Cg-3_2_at_55.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Cg-3_2_at_55.png/900px-Cg-3_2_at_55.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Cg-3_2_at_55.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_at_55.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_19\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-3_2_bg_19.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>还有一件事，不确定帮不帮得上你——我看到过一个可疑的女人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>事情发生得很突然，几乎所有人都被吓住了。只有她还无动于衷地坐在座位上……甚至在笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>嗯？你还记得那个人的特征吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉快速描述了记忆中的画面。在听完后，原本如临大敌的警员却放松了神情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>哦！你提到的应该是贝丽尔·布翁尼女士，和平街一家水晶工房的主人，一位占卜师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员：</div><div>她是这起案子的报案人，我们已经和她聊过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>她是……报案人？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AFF-02"}}